    "Not an Anchor program: instructions are a plain leading u8 tag.",
    "Instruction table is verbatim from Deriverse's OWN public common crate",
    "(github.com/deriverse/drv-smart-contract-common, crates/models/src/instruction_constants.rs).",
    "The `swap` account list is from Deriverse's own OKX integration",
    "(github.com/deriverse/okx-deriverse, programs/dex-solana/src/adapters/deriverse.rs).",
    "Full account-state structs live in that same common crate under",
    "crates/models/src/state/ (root, instrument, spots, perps, holder, token, ...);",
    "a working quoter reference implementation is github.com/deriverse/jupiter-deriverse."
